      "accuracy_note": "The English preserves peaceful sleep and the causal appeal to God as its basis. Lying down and sleeping become readiness for sound sleep, while God's provision of secure dwelling becomes restoration of the speaker's life. “Together” and “alone” are not retained in their Hebrew functions.",
